  },
  search: {
    chapter:"Chapter 4", title:"What the Light Finds", img:1,
    text:`Your flashlight beam turns silver.

Long claw marks circle the clearing. Scratched into a tree are the words:

THREE SHARDS OPEN THE GATE.

Two red eyes blink between the trees and vanish.`,
