    text:`The unicorn touches its horn to your shard.

Two beams of light shoot into the woods.

One points toward an abandoned carnival midway.

The other points toward a black cave in the hills.

A third red glow appears behind you. Something is following.`,
    enter:()=>{gainXP(25); addAbility("â¨ Unicorn Flash");},
    choices:[
